      "statement": "bind_slack_thread_id persists a Slack-location-to-thread mapping in a database table keyed by channel and timestamp, refuses to overwrite a location already mapped to a different thread, and verifies the write persisted, enforcing that a Slack location maps to at most one Open SWE thread.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://openswe/slack/records.py#L496-L529",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:adb2c948a28d1df0668cdccc489b029f7e045cb555629cf0154bba43395fa91b:"
